WEBVTT

00:02.520 --> 00:04.350
Here I go, Masao!

00:04.350 --> 00:07.610
<i>It's a desperate situation for Nankatsu!</i>

00:07.610 --> 00:09.940
Go, Skylab...!

00:09.940 --> 00:10.730
We've got them!

00:10.730 --> 00:11.900
It's a turn-around!

00:14.950 --> 00:15.540
<i>Ah!</i>

00:15.540 --> 00:16.370
<i>They can't jump!</i>

00:16.370 --> 00:17.390
<i>It's been broken!</i>

00:17.390 --> 00:20.910
<i>The Tachibana Twins have failed to perform the Skylab Hurricane!</i>

00:20.910 --> 00:22.330
It's really taken its toll, huh...

00:22.330 --> 00:23.370
Damn it!

00:23.370 --> 00:25.830
<i>It seems like both of their legs are cramping.</i>

00:25.830 --> 00:27.830
It looks like we're safe for now, somehow.

00:27.830 --> 00:28.810
Yeah.

00:28.810 --> 00:33.610
It looks like Tsubasa was right after all
about it taking a huge toll on their legs.

00:34.590 --> 00:36.080
<i>Here he comes!</i>

00:36.080 --> 00:40.890
<i>Nankatsu's Captain Tsubasa has returned
after a brief withdrawal from this battle!</i>

00:40.890 --> 00:43.690
<i>So you've returned, Tsubasa.</i>

00:43.690 --> 00:44.570
Tsubasa!

00:44.570 --> 00:46.060
Is your shoulder okay?

00:46.060 --> 00:47.440
Yeah, it's okay.

00:47.440 --> 00:49.100
Sorry Tsubasa.

00:49.100 --> 00:50.860
We messed up and let them tie the game.

00:50.860 --> 00:54.070
If they've caught up with us,
all we need to do is to pull away again.

00:54.070 --> 00:57.820
Let's show them the offense we had at the start of the first half once more!

00:57.820 --> 00:59.330
Yeah!

00:59.330 --> 01:02.770
It looks like we'll have to defend until our legs recover.

01:02.770 --> 01:03.580
Yeah.

01:03.580 --> 01:07.080
At most, we'll only be able to use the Skylab Hurricane once more this game.

01:07.080 --> 01:08.000
Tsubasa!

01:08.000 --> 01:09.170
Counting on you!

01:10.200 --> 01:14.880
<i>I can't slip my way in front of the goal where physical play is intense, because I need to avoid contact.</i>

01:14.880 --> 01:17.050
<i>I can't use Kisugi or Taki either.</i>

01:17.050 --> 01:20.180
<i>Then, there is only a single chance to score for me.</i>

01:20.180 --> 01:21.260
<i>What?!</i>

01:26.850 --> 01:30.820
<i>The only thing for it is my Drive Shot!</i>

01:30.820 --> 01:36.530
<i>After seeing Hanawa's strong defense, Tsubasa immediately gets into position to fire a decisive long shot!</i>

01:36.530 --> 01:37.890
It's coming, cameraman!

01:37.890 --> 01:40.580
Tsubasa Ozora's Drive Shot is here!

01:40.580 --> 01:41.810
Make it count, Tsubasa!

01:41.810 --> 01:42.830
Your Drive Shot!

01:42.830 --> 01:44.410
I know you can do it!

01:44.410 --> 01:45.290
Tsubasa!

01:45.290 --> 01:46.910
<i>Go!</i>

01:50.590 --> 01:51.460
Drive...

01:53.180 --> 01:55.010
Shot!

01:57.260 --> 01:59.970
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

01:57.260 --> 01:59.970
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

02:00.890 --> 02:03.560
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

02:00.890 --> 02:03.560
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

02:04.470 --> 02:07.190
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

02:04.470 --> 02:07.190
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

02:14.070 --> 02:16.900
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

02:14.070 --> 02:16.900
<i>I keep running, lying to myself</i>

02:16.900 --> 02:23.160
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete</i>

02:16.900 --> 02:23.160
<i>that I can live alone, though the loneliness makes me burn</i>

02:23.160 --> 02:29.040
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni</i>

02:23.160 --> 02:29.040
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

02:29.040 --> 02:35.630
<i>kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni</i>

02:29.040 --> 02:35.630
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

02:35.630 --> 02:39.630
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

02:35.630 --> 02:39.630
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

02:39.630 --> 02:44.140
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

02:39.630 --> 02:44.140
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

02:44.140 --> 02:49.690
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

02:44.140 --> 02:49.690
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

02:49.690 --> 02:51.270
<i>baka darou?</i>

02:49.690 --> 02:51.270
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

02:51.270 --> 02:52.480
<i>ai</i>

02:51.270 --> 02:52.480
<i>Love!</i>

02:52.480 --> 02:55.980
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

02:52.480 --> 02:55.980
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

02:55.980 --> 03:05.870
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

02:55.980 --> 03:05.870
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

03:05.870 --> 03:06.700
<i>ai</i>

03:05.870 --> 03:06.700
<i>Love!</i>

03:06.700 --> 03:10.500
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

03:06.700 --> 03:10.500
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

03:10.500 --> 03:14.500
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

03:10.500 --> 03:14.500
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

03:14.500 --> 03:20.760
<i>kono ai mo ichido taritomo</i>

03:14.500 --> 03:20.760
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.550
<i>hanasanai</i>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.550
<i>for a single moment!</i>

03:25.220 --> 03:30.230
<b><b>EPISODE 39:
NANKATSU VS. HANAWA - CONCLUSION!</b></b>

03:25.340 --> 03:26.720
<i>Go!</i>

03:26.720 --> 03:28.430
<i>Drive...</i>

03:29.900 --> 03:31.480
<i>Shot!</i>

03:31.480 --> 03:34.980
<i>Tsubasa puts all his might into it and fires a shot!</i>

03:35.680 --> 03:38.230
<i>It crosses over Hanawa's thick defensive line!</i>

03:38.230 --> 03:40.490
<i>The players can barely react!</i>

03:42.220 --> 03:45.660
<i>Aided by the drive spin on the ball,
his shot descends towards the goal!</i>

03:45.660 --> 03:47.950
<i>That's what you call a finishing shot!</i>

03:47.950 --> 03:53.830
<i>It's Tsubasa's Drive Shot, which he also attempted in their first match against Azumaichi MS.</i>

03:54.210 --> 03:56.540
<i>The keeper can't react!</i>

03:57.250 --> 03:59.100
<i>Oh no, it hits the post!</i>

03:59.100 --> 04:00.880
<i>It doesn't become a goal!</i>

04:00.880 --> 04:01.730
That was close...

04:01.730 --> 04:03.840
He was almost there.

04:03.840 --> 04:06.940
<i>The ball bounces out past the goal line.</i>

04:07.510 --> 04:09.550
<i>I failed once again...</i>

04:09.550 --> 04:11.520
<i>I was sure that I got it that time.</i>

04:11.520 --> 04:13.840
We got lucky this time around.

04:13.840 --> 04:16.180
It's the shot he used in the Azumaichi match.

04:16.180 --> 04:18.270
We need to watch out for that one.

04:19.400 --> 04:21.040
That was close, Tsubasa.

04:21.040 --> 04:21.780
Yes.

04:22.530 --> 04:26.570
<i>Oh no! Because of that shot, my shoulder and leg are...</i>

04:26.570 --> 04:29.610
<i>The one in the first game went over the post and into the nets...</i>

04:29.610 --> 04:31.380
<i>And now it hits the post.</i>

04:31.380 --> 04:33.580
<i>He's almost perfected his Drive Shot.</i>

04:34.790 --> 04:36.330
<i>Maybe it's due to his shoulder injury,</i>

04:36.330 --> 04:40.250
<i>but when he kicked the ball, his center of gravity slightly shifted left,</i>

04:40.250 --> 04:42.630
<i>and the ball curved left too.</i>

04:42.670 --> 04:46.260
<i>If that didn't happen, it surely would've gone in.</i>

04:46.850 --> 04:48.140
<i>I see.</i>

04:48.140 --> 04:50.970
<i>You shoot while adding some spin into it.</i>

04:50.970 --> 04:54.100
<i>Tsubasa's long shot doesn't become a goal either.</i>

04:54.100 --> 04:56.980
<i>The game continues in a deadlock.</i>

04:56.980 --> 05:00.830
<i>It's the fourth day of the tournament, and the third match is between Hanawa and Nankatsu.</i>

05:00.830 --> 05:04.500
<i>25 minutes have passed in the second half, and the score is tied at 2-2!</i>

05:04.500 --> 05:09.340
<i>With Hanawa prioritizing defense, can we assume they're aiming for a penalty kick shootout?</i>

05:09.340 --> 05:12.620
<i>Nankatsu has continued to attack,
but a chance to score just won't appear.</i>

05:13.150 --> 05:14.360
<i>What should we do?</i>

05:14.360 --> 05:16.540
<i>Time is running out...</i>

05:17.120 --> 05:19.340
<i>We can't score if things keep going on like this.</i>

05:19.340 --> 05:23.760
<i>No matter how, we need to score a goal before the Tachibana Twins' legs recover.</i>

05:23.760 --> 05:28.550
<i>My injured shoulder and leg are in pain, but should I try my Drive Shot once more?</i>

05:28.550 --> 05:30.300
<i>Or...</i>

05:30.300 --> 05:34.560
<i>Anyhow, I must do something.</i>

05:35.360 --> 05:36.890
<i>There's just 5 minutes left...</i>

05:36.890 --> 05:38.310
<i>We should do it now.</i>

05:38.310 --> 05:39.190
<i>Yeah!</i>

05:41.110 --> 05:46.450
<i>Hanawa's Tachibana Twins stop marking
Kisugi and Taki, and steal the ball.</i>

05:46.450 --> 05:48.490
Crap! They acted first!

05:48.490 --> 05:50.870
<i>The Tachibana Twins are up for the challenge!</i>

05:50.870 --> 05:53.620
<i>After failing their first attempt early in the second half,</i>

05:53.620 --> 05:55.870
<i>will they try to use the Skylab Hurricane once more?!</i>

05:55.870 --> 05:57.570
Are your legs okay?

05:57.570 --> 05:59.170
After them!

05:59.170 --> 06:02.670
<i>Hanawa's back line comes forward as well and they attack as a unit!</i>

06:02.670 --> 06:04.260
Fall back, everyone!

06:04.260 --> 06:09.260
Once those two get in the penalty area, whoever has the ball should send it there!

06:09.840 --> 06:10.600
Daimaru!

06:12.140 --> 06:13.930
Takasugi, we're going up!

06:13.930 --> 06:16.460
To counter that height, we have no other choice.

06:16.460 --> 06:17.140
Yeah!

06:17.140 --> 06:19.020
<i>We'll stop them no matter what.</i>

06:22.160 --> 06:22.980
Daimaru!

06:26.170 --> 06:29.140
<i>This is another low pass!</i>

06:29.140 --> 06:30.190
Oh no!

06:30.190 --> 06:31.370
It's from below after all?!

06:33.160 --> 06:34.450
Let's go!

06:35.130 --> 06:41.710
This is our last Skylab Hurricane!

06:41.710 --> 06:43.840
All right! Come on, Tachibana Twins!

06:45.800 --> 06:46.460
Go!

06:46.460 --> 06:50.050
<i>They both jump for the ball exactly at the same time.</i>

06:50.050 --> 06:50.970
Tsubasa!

06:52.160 --> 06:55.400
<i>Oh, jumping all by himself, Tsubasa just isn't fast enough.</i>

06:55.400 --> 06:56.810
<i>He can't reach!</i>

06:56.810 --> 06:58.310
Okay, I've got this!

06:58.310 --> 06:59.230
No, you don't!

06:59.230 --> 07:00.440
What!?

07:02.140 --> 07:04.910
<i>Tsubasa clears the ball with his double jump.</i>

07:04.910 --> 07:08.840
<i>After taking a second step, he breaks the Low-Flying Skylab Hurricane down!</i>

07:08.840 --> 07:10.740
You did it, Tsubasa!

07:11.950 --> 07:14.650
<i>However, Hanawa recovers the loose ball!</i>

07:14.650 --> 07:17.080
Tamai! Get the ball over here!

07:17.080 --> 07:19.830
But you can't use the Skylab Hurricane...

07:19.830 --> 07:21.170
Whatever, just give it to me!

07:21.170 --> 07:23.540
<i>The ball is sent to Masao.</i>

07:24.520 --> 07:27.210
<i>But he can't use an aerial technique now.</i>

07:27.210 --> 07:28.710
<i>Come on, Kazuo!</i>

07:28.710 --> 07:30.840
<i>Are we doing it, Masao? </i>

07:30.840 --> 07:34.680
<i>We've worked so hard towards our goal of taking Nankatsu down...</i>

07:34.680 --> 07:36.760
<i>We have another special move in store!</i>

07:36.760 --> 07:37.600
Kazuo!

07:38.950 --> 07:41.060
They've still got something up their sleeves?!

07:42.060 --> 07:44.180
<i>Masao lifts the ball.</i>

07:44.180 --> 07:46.540
<i>Kazuo dashes over!</i>

07:46.540 --> 07:48.440
<i>What is this?!</i>

07:48.440 --> 07:51.300
We're Japan's #1 duo!

07:51.300 --> 07:54.070
To prove that, we have this synchronized move!

07:56.330 --> 07:57.830
Th-this is...

07:57.830 --> 08:00.450
Twin Shot!

08:02.210 --> 08:06.840
<i>The Tachibana Twins take a shot together!</i>

08:06.840 --> 08:08.140
<i>There is only one ball...</i>

08:08.140 --> 08:09.520
<i>The ball is my friend!</i>

08:09.520 --> 08:11.200
<i>I don't care if it's my face! Come on...</i>

08:11.200 --> 08:13.930
Hit me somewhere, please!

08:13.930 --> 08:14.800
Morisaki!

08:15.340 --> 08:18.680
<i>The ball hits Morisaki's shoulder.</i>

08:19.520 --> 08:23.140
<i>Even though it shifts, it continues its course towards the goal!</i>

08:23.140 --> 08:23.770
All right!

08:24.600 --> 08:28.220
Damn it! If that one gets in, we're finished!

08:32.290 --> 08:35.230
<i>He repels it with his face!</i>

08:35.230 --> 08:37.070
<i>An excellent move from Ishizaki!</i>

08:37.830 --> 08:40.450
Yes! Show 'em your monkey's timing, Ishizaki!

08:42.370 --> 08:43.210
Ishizaki!

08:43.210 --> 08:46.430
<i>The ball is back in the game, and it gets to Tsubasa.</i>

08:46.430 --> 08:47.460
Ishizaki...

08:47.460 --> 08:49.680
I'm fine.

08:49.680 --> 08:51.460
Forget about me, go and attack!

08:51.460 --> 08:54.370
Hanawa's defense is weak now.

08:55.050 --> 08:56.260
Okay, got it.

08:56.260 --> 08:57.930
Time for a counter-attack!

08:57.930 --> 08:59.760
That's bad, return!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.560
<i>Tsubasa dribbles away with the ball!</i>

09:05.560 --> 09:08.400
<i>He quickly makes his way towards the opposing side!</i>

09:08.400 --> 09:10.400
All right! Keep going, Tsubasa!

09:10.400 --> 09:13.900
<i>I must use this chance Ishizaki created for us.</i>

09:13.900 --> 09:15.560
We need to get back, too!

09:15.560 --> 09:16.200
Yeah!

09:16.200 --> 09:16.950
Izawa!

09:17.450 --> 09:19.530
<i>Tsubasa passes the ball to Izawa.</i>

09:20.160 --> 09:22.410
<i>And he keeps advancing.</i>

09:22.410 --> 09:26.670
<i>Hanawa is running back as hard as they can,
but their defense is in complete disarray!</i>

09:27.400 --> 09:28.130
Tsubasa!

09:28.130 --> 09:29.880
<i>Izawa sends the ball back to the middle!</i>

09:31.940 --> 09:34.400
<i>Is this his chance to shoot?!</i>

09:34.400 --> 09:37.510
<i>That's close enough for Tsubasa to try a long shot.</i>

09:37.510 --> 09:39.510
Is it another Drive Shot?

09:40.930 --> 09:45.310
<i>But if I fail, Ishizaki's effort will amount to nothing.</i>

09:46.060 --> 09:48.560
<i>I don't care about my injury or anything!</i>

09:48.560 --> 09:50.370
<i>I will break through the middle!</i>

09:50.370 --> 09:53.070
<i>Tsubasa doesn't shoot!</i>

09:53.070 --> 09:55.320
<i>He dashes towards the goal.</i>

09:55.320 --> 09:56.320
Tsubasa!

09:56.320 --> 09:57.570
What on earth...?

09:57.570 --> 09:58.280
Stop him!

09:58.280 --> 09:59.320
We'll crush him!

09:59.320 --> 10:00.820
<i>I'm against three of them.</i>

10:04.160 --> 10:05.900
<i>Tsubasa is keeping the ball.</i>

10:05.900 --> 10:07.790
<i>Will he break through all of them?!</i>

10:08.920 --> 10:10.170
<i>All right, I've got this.</i>

10:11.170 --> 10:12.160
<i>A fourth one?</i>

10:12.160 --> 10:12.920
Damn you!

10:13.530 --> 10:15.850
<i>Hanawa won't lose when it comes to fighting spirit!</i>

10:15.850 --> 10:18.260
<i>Aimoto attacks with a shoulder charge.</i>

10:18.880 --> 10:21.680
<i>Tsubasa loses his balance for the first time!</i>

10:21.680 --> 10:23.060
Okay, I got the ball.

10:23.060 --> 10:24.430
<i>Like I'd give it to you!</i>

10:25.100 --> 10:25.850
What?!

10:28.790 --> 10:29.650
<i>My shoulder...</i>

10:30.070 --> 10:30.860
All right.

10:30.860 --> 10:32.940
<i>Hanawa's goalkeeper runs out to recover the ball!</i>

10:32.940 --> 10:34.610
<i>Nice judgment!</i>

10:34.610 --> 10:37.090
Kazuo! We'll protect the goal!

10:37.090 --> 10:37.990
Yeah!

10:37.990 --> 10:39.540
This pain is nothing!

10:39.540 --> 10:43.990
As the captain, I can't afford to do less than Ishizaki!

10:44.490 --> 10:47.020
<i>The goalkeeper is a second too late!</i>

10:47.020 --> 10:49.250
<i>A sliding shot from Tsubasa!</i>

10:49.250 --> 10:51.450
<i>The ball is on its way to the open goal.</i>

10:51.450 --> 10:52.380
This time, it's in!

10:52.380 --> 10:53.630
Not yet!

10:53.630 --> 10:56.630
Go!

10:57.460 --> 11:01.210
<i>Hanawa is trying to stop it with the Tachibana Twins' Skylab Hurricane.</i>

11:01.210 --> 11:03.850
You still had that much strength left in your legs?

11:03.850 --> 11:05.930
I'll stop it!

11:05.930 --> 11:06.850
What?!

11:09.230 --> 11:12.480
<i>Tsubasa's shot stabs the back of the net!</i>

11:12.480 --> 11:14.090
<i>Nankatsu takes the lead!</i>

11:14.090 --> 11:15.610
<i>3-2!</i>

11:15.610 --> 11:17.860
It's in!

11:18.260 --> 11:19.100
Yes!

11:19.100 --> 11:20.360
Tsubasa!

11:20.360 --> 11:22.110
He did it!

11:22.110 --> 11:23.110
You did it!

11:23.110 --> 11:25.320
That's our Captain Tsubasa!

11:25.320 --> 11:27.240
He scores when he's supposed to.

11:27.240 --> 11:30.420
That little idiot did push himself.

11:30.420 --> 11:33.250
I'll have to treat him from scratch now.

11:34.000 --> 11:37.500
Just a little more, and I would've made it...

11:38.630 --> 11:40.680
<i>The Tachibana Twins are mortified!</i>

11:40.680 --> 11:42.380
<i>Hanawa MS is mortified!</i>

11:43.620 --> 11:46.390
<i>The final whistle blows.</i>

11:46.390 --> 11:48.070
We did it! We won!

11:48.070 --> 11:50.140
The third game's over!

11:50.140 --> 11:53.740
<i>Nankatsu is the first team to advance to the quarter-finals.</i>

11:53.740 --> 11:55.930
We... we lost.

11:56.650 --> 12:01.030
After all is said and done, it's gotta be Nankatsu, y'know.

12:01.030 --> 12:05.060
<i>Still, this match has been a fierce one with a lot of excitement.</i>

12:05.060 --> 12:06.570
<i>Hanawa fought bravely.</i>

12:06.570 --> 12:09.330
<i>The spectators send them off with vigorous applause.</i>

12:09.880 --> 12:11.890
<i>This could've easily been a finals match.</i>

12:11.890 --> 12:15.330
<i>It was the best third match that's ever been played.</i>

12:15.980 --> 12:19.400
I don't particularly care if it's close or easy for you...

12:19.400 --> 12:22.840
Just keep winning until the final, Tsubasa.

12:22.840 --> 12:26.600
I will crush you when the time comes!

12:29.010 --> 12:30.980
Hey, Hyuga!

12:30.980 --> 12:32.980
Matsuyama?

12:42.990 --> 12:45.490
INFIRMARY

12:44.210 --> 12:49.690
I told you not to go for any close contact, and yet there you go again!

12:50.770 --> 12:53.960
Well, football and injuries go hand-in-hand.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.000
Owie, ow, ow...

12:55.000 --> 12:56.630
Are you all right, Tsubasa?!

12:56.630 --> 12:57.610
Tsubasa...

12:57.610 --> 12:58.250
Does it hurt?

12:58.250 --> 12:59.350
Tsubasa?

13:01.130 --> 13:02.060
The heck!

13:02.060 --> 13:04.120
Why? Why is it only Tsubasa?

13:04.120 --> 13:05.930
I got hurt too, you know?!

13:05.930 --> 13:07.420
Oh yeah, that's right!

13:07.420 --> 13:09.220
We completely forgot.

13:09.220 --> 13:10.160
Izawa!

13:10.160 --> 13:12.010
I'm joking, I'm joking!

13:16.880 --> 13:19.170
How's your shoulder, Tsubasa?

13:19.170 --> 13:20.520
The Tachibana Twins!

13:20.520 --> 13:21.940
Tachibana.

13:21.940 --> 13:23.880
I don't know what to say...

13:23.880 --> 13:26.350
I'm sorry. It's because of me...

13:26.350 --> 13:28.700
It's okay. It was an accident, after all.

13:28.700 --> 13:31.200
Anyway, thanks for checking up on me.

13:32.630 --> 13:35.630
Oh yeah, nice job out there, chimp!

13:35.630 --> 13:37.680
We've lost to you!

13:37.680 --> 13:39.580
The "chimp" part was unnecessary!

13:39.580 --> 13:42.050
Every single person...

13:42.050 --> 13:44.320
Make sure to do our part too.

13:44.320 --> 13:46.530
I won't forgive you if you lose!

13:46.530 --> 13:48.050
You can count on us.

13:48.050 --> 13:50.130
We'll make sure we'll win.

13:54.770 --> 13:57.300
So, you're not injured?

13:57.300 --> 14:00.150
Yeah. It's not an injury, or anything like that.

14:00.150 --> 14:02.780
So why aren't you playing in any of the matches?

14:02.780 --> 14:06.570
It doesn't concern you.

14:06.570 --> 14:08.250
It does concern me!

14:08.250 --> 14:10.490
I still owe you one.

14:10.490 --> 14:16.930
Or did you forget when I said I'd pay you back in a match?

14:18.920 --> 14:20.170
Bringing up such an old story...

14:20.170 --> 14:25.540
Anyway... We, Furano, will defeat Tsubasa and are planning to take you down in the finals.

14:25.540 --> 14:29.180
I don't know what happened, but you'd better play in the finals.

14:30.400 --> 14:34.400
That's all I have to say. See ya.

14:39.850 --> 14:42.860
All right everybody. Get in the bus.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.960
Oh, Hyuga!

14:47.960 --> 14:49.610
Hyuga?

14:50.600 --> 14:53.630
Hey, Hyuga! What the hell are you doing here?

14:53.630 --> 14:55.630
You didn't play in today's match?

14:55.630 --> 14:58.960
Don't go underestimating us,
just because Toho's a strong team!

14:58.960 --> 15:03.340
Don't you worry, I'll be there in the finals.

15:03.340 --> 15:05.960
So it's not an injury then, right, Hyuga?

15:06.970 --> 15:07.970
That's right.

15:07.970 --> 15:13.100
Then let's have another Nankatsu vs. Toho battle in the finals, for the third time in a row.

15:16.970 --> 15:20.900
You'd better make sure you're in top form until the finals!

15:20.900 --> 15:23.190
Otherwise, crushing you will have no meaning!

15:32.310 --> 15:34.060
<i>The match ends!</i>

15:34.060 --> 15:35.410
<i>It's 3-0!</i>

15:35.410 --> 15:38.160
<i>Tokyo's representatives, Toho Academy,</i>

15:38.160 --> 15:42.170
<i>beat Gifu's Myoko MS, earning their place in the best eight!</i>

15:42.170 --> 15:45.170
I did it, Hyuga.

15:52.040 --> 15:53.780
Here, send it!

15:53.780 --> 15:55.260
Oh, big brother!

15:55.260 --> 15:56.090
Hey!

15:56.090 --> 15:57.190
Good afternoon.

15:57.190 --> 15:59.100
He's a friend of yours, right?

15:59.100 --> 16:00.980
He's been playing with us for a bit!

16:00.980 --> 16:05.570
Why are you here? Did you punks come all the way here just to see my dirty house?

16:05.570 --> 16:07.860
You didn't play today, did you?

16:09.400 --> 16:11.310
I heard some things from your mom.

16:11.310 --> 16:12.810
What's the meaning of this?

16:12.810 --> 16:15.400
Not playing in matches, then saying you will quit Toho...

16:15.400 --> 16:17.080
Get to the point. What do you want?

16:18.070 --> 16:19.670
Then I will.

16:19.670 --> 16:22.010
I only came to do one thing.

16:22.010 --> 16:26.080
You guys became the Tokyo representatives by beating us, Musashi.

16:26.080 --> 16:31.010
I don't want Tokyo's representatives putting on a horrible show and

16:31.010 --> 16:34.340
being defeated by a no-name team without you on the pitch.

16:34.340 --> 16:35.970
That's all.

16:42.380 --> 16:44.850
If that's all, you're free to go back home.

16:44.850 --> 16:46.610
Big brother...

16:48.240 --> 16:48.940
Let's go.

16:48.940 --> 16:49.540
Huh?

16:49.540 --> 16:50.610
Okay.

16:53.110 --> 16:56.240
I'm relieved to see your condition and health look fine.

16:56.240 --> 16:58.730
It looks like it's not due to injury.

16:58.730 --> 17:01.580
The only person left who can defeat Tsubasa is you.

17:01.580 --> 17:04.610
I'm looking forward to the final match.

17:04.610 --> 17:05.400
See you later, okay?

17:05.400 --> 17:06.220
Sure.

17:08.850 --> 17:09.770
Tch...

17:10.960 --> 17:12.890
<i>All of them...</i>

17:12.890 --> 17:15.680
<i>Worrying needlessly over someone like me...</i>

17:17.430 --> 17:18.300
Big brother!

17:18.300 --> 17:18.950
Don't get near!

17:18.950 --> 17:19.970
Huh?

17:19.970 --> 17:22.350
Don't you come here, Takeru!

17:22.350 --> 17:25.790
Just you watch. I'll play.

17:25.790 --> 17:29.190
I will play for sure, and I will win it all!

17:33.520 --> 17:36.070
<i>On the fifth day of the tournament,</i>

17:36.070 --> 17:40.830
<i>the battle between the best eight teams in the quarter-finals is upon us this morning.</i>

17:40.830 --> 17:45.630
<i>Nankatsu MS from Shizuoka vs. Hirado MS from Nagasaki,</i>

17:45.630 --> 17:47.980
<i>and Minamiuwa MS from Ehime vs. Furano MS from Hokkaido</i>

17:47.980 --> 17:53.430
<i>will have their respective matches on Block A.</i>

17:53.430 --> 17:57.720
<i>Toho Academy from Tokyo vs. Chubu MS from Nagano,</i>

17:57.720 --> 18:02.620
<i>and Meiwa Higashi from Saitama vs. Kanamura MS from Miyazaki</i>

18:02.620 --> 18:05.350
<i>will have their respective matches on Block B.</i>

18:15.810 --> 18:16.240
Huh?

18:16.910 --> 18:17.860
Hyuga!

18:17.860 --> 18:18.950
Captain!

18:18.950 --> 18:21.700
Coach, I will take my place on the bench again from today on.

18:21.700 --> 18:22.810
Oh!

18:22.810 --> 18:26.330
Hah, you are as self-centered as always.

18:26.330 --> 18:30.060
Your admission as a player was done before the tournament.

18:30.060 --> 18:31.960
I don't mind you being on bench, however...

18:31.960 --> 18:34.000
I won't let you in the match.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.260
Oh...

18:35.260 --> 18:38.090
You should allow me to play if you want to win.

18:44.510 --> 18:46.850
<i>The match ends here.</i>

18:46.850 --> 18:51.610
<i>The quarter-finals' first match is won by the hosting prefecture, Saitama's representative</i>

18:51.610 --> 18:56.110
<i>Meiwa Higashi, who beat Kanamura MS from Miyazaki 2-0, taking their place amongst the best four!</i>

18:56.110 --> 18:58.560
<i>They are the first to advance to the semi-finals!</i>

18:58.560 --> 19:00.610
So Meiwa Higashi is the first one.

19:00.610 --> 19:03.170
The tournament is nearing its end, isn't it?

19:03.170 --> 19:08.870
Yes. The selection process for the 24 candidates for the Selection Team has gotten quite interesting.

19:08.870 --> 19:16.630
<i>I will choose the strongest 24 junior players in Japan in this tournament and start by taking them to a training camp.</i>

19:16.630 --> 19:22.340
<i>After that, a visit to the main stage, Europe, awaits them.</i>

19:22.980 --> 19:25.230
All right! Let's take a look at your left leg now.

19:25.230 --> 19:26.100
Eh?

19:26.100 --> 19:28.350
You can't fool my old eyes, kiddie.

19:28.350 --> 19:32.230
It's not just your shoulder. Your left leg is hurt too, isn't it?

19:32.230 --> 19:33.910
But it's already...

19:33.910 --> 19:35.730
It's all right, just show it to me.

19:35.730 --> 19:39.110
What's this? You've already applied taping there?

19:39.110 --> 19:40.240
Yes.

19:40.240 --> 19:43.560
Those are some good taping skills, there!

19:43.560 --> 19:45.990
Did that manager girl do it?

19:45.990 --> 19:48.610
Well... Yeah...

19:48.610 --> 19:50.970
What's with that response?

19:50.970 --> 19:51.500
Wha—

19:51.500 --> 19:52.250
Ouch!

19:52.250 --> 19:56.130
Are you being shy or what? It must be nice to be young!

19:58.130 --> 20:00.920
So the next game is Toho vs. Chubu MS.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.800
Hey there, Yukari!

20:03.980 --> 20:05.800
It's Hirado MS's Jito!

20:05.800 --> 20:09.560
I'm happy you guys have managed to keep winning somehow, until now.

20:09.560 --> 20:11.820
What's the high and mighty act for?

20:11.820 --> 20:15.060
You've barely been eking by with one-goal differences, Hiroshi!

20:15.060 --> 20:17.440
Oh? Is that how it happened?

20:18.400 --> 20:19.320
Wha—

20:20.070 --> 20:24.000
We're here specifically to play against you, Nankatsu.

20:24.000 --> 20:26.200
We really don't care about the other matches.

20:26.200 --> 20:27.410
What did you just say?

20:27.410 --> 20:34.290
It's not nice to beat the team my cousin's in, but Nankatsu's win-streak will end here, y'know.

20:34.290 --> 20:38.670
After our match today, your legend will crumble and fall, y'know.

20:38.670 --> 20:39.810
What?

20:39.810 --> 20:42.300
Well, we'll see about that.

20:46.080 --> 20:47.510
Tsubasa!

20:47.510 --> 20:53.210
Oh, if it isn't Nankatsu's captain, Tsubasa Ozora!

20:53.210 --> 20:56.770
Let's aim for victory and do our best today, y'know.

20:57.310 --> 21:00.410
I'm the captain of Hirado MS, Hiroshi Jito, y'know.

21:00.410 --> 21:01.560
Nice to meet you.

21:01.560 --> 21:02.440
My pleasure.

21:10.410 --> 21:13.000
Seriously, I'm glad to have met you, y'know.

21:22.010 --> 21:22.760
Hyuga!

21:22.760 --> 21:24.130
Kojiro Hyuga!

21:24.130 --> 21:24.880
Oh...

21:24.880 --> 21:26.260
Hyuga!

21:28.010 --> 21:29.300
Hey, it's Hyuga!

21:29.300 --> 21:30.260
Hyuga is there!

21:30.260 --> 21:32.020
So he'll play today.

21:32.020 --> 21:33.780
Hyuga's on the pitch.

21:33.780 --> 21:35.730
So Hyuga will finally play.

21:37.480 --> 21:38.690
Hyuga!

21:41.720 --> 21:44.610
<i>I don't care if you say that you won't let me play.</i>

21:44.610 --> 21:50.620
<i>However, if you don't use me in the finals, in the match against Nankatsu, winning is impossible.</i>

21:51.370 --> 21:59.710
<i>For the sake of Toho's victory, what I have to do now is to bring out the best of my teammates until the finals.</i>

21:59.710 --> 22:02.960
<i>That's something I must do now!</i>

22:06.590 --> 22:11.680
<i>Even though he didn't use much force in that shot, it's much stronger than last year.</i>

22:11.680 --> 22:15.180
<i>So Hyuga really wasn't injured...</i>

22:15.180 --> 22:20.020
<i>I will definitely play in these finals!</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.800
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.800 --> 22:50.800
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.800 --> 22:56.850
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.850 --> 23:01.480
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:07.780
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.110 --> 23:15.200
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.200 --> 23:21.250
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.250 --> 23:25.710
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.010 --> 23:33.350
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.010 --> 23:33.350
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.350 --> 23:39.390
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.390 --> 23:45.690
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.990 --> 24:00.510
COMING UP, EPISODE 40:
FURANO GOES TO WAR
